<title>USA: TABLE-Men's Wearhouse July same-store rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Men's Wearhouse July same-store rises.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$37.4	$26.9     +38.9	+13.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $264.6     $202.6     +30.6	 +5.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended August 2.</p>
<p>Full company name is Men's Wearhouse.</p>
<p>The company said comparable store sales information for each of the periods in 1997 does not include sales from C&amp;R stores, which the company acquired in mid-January 1997, or the NAL stores which the company acquired in early May 1997.</p>
</text>
